{"id":"wb-1-69","name":"祜国寺塔（铁塔）","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"开宝寺琉璃塔","text":"开宝寺琉璃塔，又称祐国寺塔，是位于中国河南省开封市的塔，因通体红褐色琉璃，又得名铁塔，是中国保存至今最早、最高的一座琉璃砖塔。该塔所在的佑国寺则已不复存在。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BC%80%E5%AE%9D%E5%AF%BA%E7%90%89%E7%92%83%E5%A1%94","revisionId":93589540,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93589540","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核名录别名、历史建筑与对应百科条目；旧行政地址不作为唯一判断依据","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/12e2531ee3b4f55b84620068.jpg","title":"20250622_Iron_Pagoda_Park_07.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250622_Iron_Pagoda_Park_07.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8a/20250622_Iron_Pagoda_Park_07.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​开封铁塔（开宝寺塔）","width":320,"height":480,"matchEvidence":"已复核文物对应百科条目的主图","subject":"开宝寺琉璃塔"}}